# strand-eval reference recordings (docs/eval.md, "Reference recordings"). Written by `strand-eval approve` and `verdict`; a block edited by hand fails its seal.
ref "tray-submenu-shadow"
verdict good
note "eval-coverage-3 first reference, read frame by frame: the tray menu (shadow 0 8px 20px) opens under its item at the bar's start, the hover glides across its rows, Send to and Preferences each open a shadowed submenu level with their row and 6 px right of the menu, one fading as the other opens, and both close back to the bar"
date 2026-10-19
rev "a7965714+changes"
approver "claude"
scenario 8dfd8d12a1d734b5
